[E-TYPE-MISMATCH] Error: type mismatch
    ╭─[ reject/data-auto-ordering-differs.sw:21:24 ]
    │
 21 │ def wrong: Nat := size down
    │                        ──┬─  
    │                          ╰─── expected `Map Nat Nat [ord := { compare = Nat.compare }]`, but this has type `Map Nat Nat [ord := { compare = m n => if Nat.equal n m then Equal else if Nat.leq n m then Less else Greater }]`
    │ 
    │ Note: the `ord` dictionaries differ: `Map`'s `ord` is part of its type, so a value built with one is a different type from one built with another (they're compared as whole dictionaries, not just their functions)
────╯
